</style>
<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 972)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Attachments reach the room.</b> A file put on a note travels to every seat in a shared review, sealed; the host keeps the file with the session and clears the relay's copy once it has it. Late arrivals get it from the host.</li>
<li><b>&#8984;V pastes into the note.</b> An image on the clipboard (or a copied file) becomes an attachment on the note you are writing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
